<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Home - Symfony Security Demo</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif; 
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 90%;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        h1 {
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .welcome-message {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .instructions {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        .instructions h3 {
            color: #495057;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        
        .credentials {
            background: #e7f3ff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            background: #667eea;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
            margin: 10px;
        }
        
        .btn:hover {
            background: #764ba2;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>🔐 Symfony Security Demo</h1>
        
        <div class="welcome-message">
            {{ message }}
        </div>
        
        <div class="instructions">
            <h3>📋 Activity 2: In-Memory Authentication</h3>
            <p>Test the protected dashboard with different user roles:</p>
            
            <div class="credentials">
                <p><strong>Admin User:</strong> admin / admin123</p>
                <p><strong>Regular User:</strong> user / user123</p>
            </div>
            
            <p><strong>Expected Behavior:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Admin sees full access message</li>
                <li>Regular user sees limited access message</li>
                <li>Unauthenticated users get login prompt</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <a href="/dashboard" class="btn">🚀 Access Dashboard</a>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 30px; color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px;">
            <p>Click the button above to test the authentication system</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>